---
export const prerender = true;
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead
			title={`Privacy - ${SITE_TITLE}`}
			description="How Recableado handles the details of readers who sign up for new-publication alerts."
			lang="en"
			alternateUrl="/privacidad"
		/>
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header lang="en" alternateUrl="/privacidad" />
		<main class="privacy-page">
			<p class="eyebrow">Recableado privacy</p>
			<h1>Your data is not the price of admission</h1>
			<p class="lead">
				This policy applies only to the details you provide to receive Recableado updates.
				Signing up for the blog does not authorise Viajes Scibasku to send you travel offers.
			</p>

			<section>
				<h2>Who is responsible</h2>
				<p>The data controller is <strong>Giora Gilead Elenberg</strong>, the author of Recableado.</p>
				<p>You can contact him or exercise your rights by writing to <a href="mailto:reca@viajesscibasku.com">reca@viajesscibasku.com</a>.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>What I collect</h2>
				<p>The form asks for your name and email address. You may also choose whether you are interested in how I use AI, what I am building or both.</p>
				<p>The server also processes technical data such as your IP address temporarily to prevent abuse and protect the form. Your IP address is not added to the subscriber list.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Why I use it and the legal basis</h2>
				<p>I use your name, email and chosen interest only to manage your subscription and tell you when I publish an article or build something worth showing. The legal basis is your consent.</p>
				<p>You will receive a confirmation email before the subscription becomes active. If you do not confirm, you will not receive Recableado updates.</p>
				<p>Technical abuse prevention is based on the legitimate interest in keeping the form secure and available. I do not use this data for automated decision-making or profiling with legal effects.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>How long I keep it</h2>
				<p>Details for a confirmed subscription are kept for as long as you wish to receive updates. When you unsubscribe or withdraw consent, they will no longer be used to send them; only the minimum information needed to address possible legal liabilities will remain, duly restricted.</p>
				<p>Requests that are not confirmed are kept only for the time needed to complete the double opt-in process and resolve technical issues.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>Who it is shared with</h2>
				<p>Your details are stored in dedicated Recableado lists. They are not combined with Viajes Scibasku's commercial segmentation, used to send travel offers, sold or disclosed to third parties for their own purposes.</p>
				<p>Technical providers for hosting, subscription management and email delivery may process the data in order to operate the form, manage subscriptions and send emails. They act on behalf of the controller and only to provide those services.</p>
				<p>Some of these providers may process data outside the European Economic Area. Where this happens, the safeguards required by the GDPR will apply, such as an adequacy decision or standard contractual clauses.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2>How to unsubscribe and exercise your rights</h2>
				<p>You can unsubscribe through the link included in every email or write to <a href="mailto:reca@viajesscibasku.com">reca@viajesscibasku.com</a>. Withdrawing consent does not affect processing carried out before it was withdrawn.</p>
				<p>You may also request access, rectification, erasure, restriction, objection or portability of your data. If you believe your rights have not been respected, you may lodge a complaint with the <a href="https://www.aepd.es" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Spanish Data Protection Agency</a>.</p>
			</section>

			<p class="updated">Last updated: 19 August 2026.</p>
		</main>
		<Footer lang="en" />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.privacy-page {
		box-sizing: border-box;
		width: min(760px, 100%);
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 6rem) 1.5rem;
	}
	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
		color: var(--naranja);
		font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}
	h1 { margin-top: 0; }
	.lead {
		font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
		line-height: 1.65;
	}
	section {
		margin-top: 2.5rem;
	}
	section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
		font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2vw, 1.65rem);
	}
	section p { margin: 0.65rem 0; }
	a { text-underline-offset: 0.16em; }
	.updated {
		margin-top: 3.5rem;
		color: var(--text-light);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
</style>
